= International Relations

- @america: Building relationship with our home country could help benefit us in the long run.
- @un: Expand our reach towards the biggest organization that aims for world peace.
- @eu: Approach the European Union.
- @root: We don't need to form contracts for now.
- @easy_discard

@america
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; america_relation += 1

We decided to approach America.

